OL,3,GNEWSAChief's funding plea to tackle
OL,4,Amoor fire threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior firefighter has joined calls
OL,7,Ffor more government funding to tackle
OL,8,Fthe growing threat of moor fires.
OL,10,FLee Miller, a district commander for
OL,11,FWest Yorkshire Fire & Rescue Service,
OL,12,Fsaid this year had been one of the
OL,13,Fbusiest on record.
OL,15,FCrews tackled their first moor fire on
OL,16,FMarsden Moor near Huddersfield in April
OL,17,Fwith others appearing across the county
OL,18,Fthroughout the summer, including in
OL,19,FSilsden and Baildon near Bradford, and
OL,20,FEast Ardsley near the M1 in Leeds.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
